.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
To override individual configuration items, append \-\-return_kwargs \(aq{"key:": "value"}\(aq to the salt command.
.sp
New in version 2016.3.0.

.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq test.ping \-\-return mysql \-\-return_kwargs \(aq{"db": "another\-salt"}\(aq
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
