Jinja supports a \fI\%secure, sandboxed template execution environment\fP that Salt
takes advantage of. Other text renderers do not support this
functionality, so Salt highly recommends usage of \fBjinja\fP / \fBjinja|yaml\fP\&.
.UNINDENT
