.ft C
{{ \(aqfe80::\(aq | is_ipv6 }}
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS \fBipaddr\fP
.sp
New in version 2017.7.0.

.sp
From a list, returns only valid IP entries. Supports the same options
as \fBis_ip\fP\&. The list can contains also IP interfaces/networks.
.sp
Example:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
