.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt\-cloud \-f list_affinity_groups my\-azure
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS show_affinity_group
.sp
Show an affinity group associated with the account
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
