Optional. A longer description of the affinity group.
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt\-cloud \-f create_affinity_group my\-azure name=my_affinity_group \e
   label=my\-affinity\-group location=\(aqWest US\(aq
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS update_affinity_group
