salt\-cloud \-f update_affinity_group my\-azure name=my_group label=my_group
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS delete_affinity_group
.sp
Delete a specific affinity group associated with the account
.INDENT 0.0
