.TP
.B class salt.beacons.watchdog.Handler(queue, masks=None)
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B on_created(event)
Called when a file or directory is created.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Parameters
\fBevent\fP (\fBDirCreatedEvent\fP or \fBFileCreatedEvent\fP) \-\- Event representing file/directory creation.
