.SS salt.grains.nvme
.sp
Grains for NVMe Qualified Names (NQN).
.sp
New in version 3000.

.sp
To enable these grains set \fInvme_grains: True\fP in the minion config.
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
nvme_grains: True
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
