.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq pkg.list_pkgs
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B salt.modules.aixpkg.remove(name=None, pkgs=None, **kwargs)
Remove specified fileset(s)/rpm package(s).
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B name
The name of the fileset or rpm package to be deleted.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Multiple Package Options:
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
