Must be passed as a python list. The \fBname\fP parameter will be
ignored if this option is passed.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Returns a list containing the removed packages.
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
