Return list of directives together with expected arguments
and places where the directive is valid (\fBapachectl \-L\fP)
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq apache.directives
.ft P
.fi
