The enable mode password if required by the destination node.
.sp
\fBNOTE:\fP
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
This argument does not need to be specified when running in a
\fBpyeapi\fP Proxy Minion.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq pyeapi.config commands="[\(aqntp server 1.2.3.4\(aq, \(aqntp server 5.6.7.8\(aq]"
salt \(aq*\(aq pyeapi.config config_file=salt://config.txt
