.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Parameters
.INDENT 7.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBname\fP \-\- specify a specific module to list. If not specified, all modules will be listed.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBnames_only\fP \-\- Return only a list of the callable functions instead of a dictionary with arguments
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.sp
(example truncated for brevity)
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt myminion baredoc.list_states

myminion:
    \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
[...]
  at:
  \- present:
      name: null
      timespec: null
      tag: null
      user: null
      job: null
      unique_tag: false
   \- absent:
      name: null
      jobid: null
      kwargs: kwargs
   \- watch:
      name: null
      timespec: null
      tag: null
      user: null
      job: null
      unique_tag: false
   \- mod_watch:
      name: null
      kwargs: kwargs
[...]
.ft P
.fi
