.B Parameters
.INDENT 7.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBdatastore\fP (\fBDatastoreType\fP (\fBstr\fP enum).) \-\- The datastore, e.g. running, operational.
One of the NETCONF store IETF types
.IP \(bu 2
\fBname\fP (\fBstr\fP) \-\- an ID of the rollback to restore
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
