.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq cmd.run "ls \-l | awk \(aq/foo/{print \e\e$2}\(aq"
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The template arg can be set to \(aqjinja\(aq or another supported template
engine to render the command arguments before execution.
For example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
