.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq daemontools.disabled <service name>
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
