.sp
NOTE: The syncdb command was deprecated in Django 1.7 and removed in Django 1.9.
For Django versions 1.9 or higher use the \fImigrate\fP command instead.
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq django.syncdb <settings_module>
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
