.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq pkg.purge <package name>
salt \(aq*\(aq pkg.purge <package name> slot=4.4
salt \(aq*\(aq pkg.purge <package1>,<package2>,<package3>
salt \(aq*\(aq pkg.purge pkgs=\(aq["foo", "bar"]\(aq
.ft P
