.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B salt.modules.extfs.blocks(device, args=None)
Return block and inode info from dumpe2fs for a specified device
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq extfs.blocks /dev/sda1
.ft P
.fi
