.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq file.apply_template_on_contents \e
    contents=\(aqThis is a {{ template }} string.\(aq \e
    template=jinja \e
    "context={}" "defaults={\(aqtemplate\(aq: \(aqcool\(aq}" \e
    saltenv=base
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
