.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq ports.showconfig security/nmap
salt \(aq*\(aq ports.showconfig security/nmap default=True
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
