\fBcheckout\fP subcommand), in a single string. This is useful for
passing \fB\-c\fP to run git with temporary changes to the git
configuration.
.sp
New in version 2017.7.0.

.sp
\fBNOTE:\fP
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
This is only supported in git 1.7.2 and newer.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.TP
