from any git commands which are run. This should not be needed in most
cases.
.sp
\fBNOTE:\fP
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
This should only be needed if the files in the repository were
created with filenames using an encoding other than UTF\-8 to handle
Unicode characters.
