.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B salt.modules.inspector.inspect(mode=\(aqall\(aq, priority=19, **kwargs)
Start node inspection and save the data to the database for further query.
.sp
Parameters:
