.IP \(bu 2
\fBmode\fP: Clarify inspection mode: configuration, payload, all (default)
.INDENT 2.0
.TP
.B payload
.INDENT 7.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBfilter\fP: Comma\-separated directories to track payload.
