.IP \(bu 2
\fBFalse\fP: the ticket exists and it has not been closed.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBNone\fP: the ticket does not exist.
.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq jira.issue_closed NE\-123
.ft P
.fi
