.B salt.modules.junos.shutdown(**kwargs)
Shut down (power off) or reboot a device running Junos OS. This includes
all Routing Engines in a Virtual Chassis or a dual Routing Engine system.
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
\fBNOTE:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
