.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aqkdc.example.com\(aq kerberos.create_keytab host/host1.example.com host1.example.com.keytab
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
