\fBNOTE:\fP
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
An immediate reboot often shuts down the system before the minion has a
chance to return, resulting in errors. A minimal delay (1 minute) is
useful to ensure the result is delivered to the master.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
