.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq pkg.latest_version <package name>
salt \(aq*\(aq pkg.latest_version <package1> <package2> <package3>
.ft P
.fi
