A string value representing the number of seconds the system will
delay restart after power loss
.TP
.B Return type
\fI\%str\fP
.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq system.get_restart_delay
