.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Return data:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
{\(aqquery time\(aq: {\(aqhuman\(aq: \(aq39.0ms\(aq, \(aqraw\(aq: \(aq0.03899\(aq}, \(aqrows affected\(aq: 1L}
.ft P
.fi
