\fBcp.get_url\fP), e.g., \fBsalt://\fP,
\fBhttps://\fP, \fBs3://\fP, \fBftp:/\fP, etc.
.TP
.B source2: \fBrunning\fP
The source from where to retrieve the configuration to compare with.
