.TP
.B salt.modules.napalm_network.commit(inherit_napalm_device=None, **kwargs)
Commits the configuration changes made on the network device.
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq net.commit
.ft P
