.IP \(bu 2
already_configured (bool): flag to check if there were no changes applied
.IP \(bu 2
diff (str): returns the config changes applied
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
