.UNINDENT
.sp
Returns a single dictionary
.sp
To get an item based on ID.
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt myminion netbox.get dcim devices id=123
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
