salt \(aq*\(aq nxos_api.show \(aqshow bgp sessions\(aq \(aqshow processes\(aq raw_text=False
salt \(aqregular\-minion\(aq nxos_api.show \(aqshow interfaces\(aq host=sw01.example.com username=test password=test
.ft P
.fi
