.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B salt.modules.pf.flush(modifier)
Flush the specified packet filter parameters.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B modifier:
Should be one of the following:
.INDENT 7.0
