all
.IP \(bu 2
info
.IP \(bu 2
osfp
.IP \(bu 2
rules
.IP \(bu 2
sources
.IP \(bu 2
states
.IP \(bu 2
tables
.UNINDENT
.sp
Please refer to the OpenBSD \fI\%pfctl(8)\fP
documentation for a detailed explanation of each command.
.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
