.sp
\fBNOTE:\fP
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
If the version of pip available is older than 8.0.3, the list will not
include the packages \fBpip\fP, \fBwheel\fP, \fBsetuptools\fP, or
\fBdistribute\fP even if they are installed.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
