salt \(aq*\(aq pkg.backup /tmp/pkg
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B jail
Backup packages from the specified jail. Note that this will run the
command within the jail, and so the path to the backup file will be
relative to the root of the jail
.sp
