salt \(aq*\(aq pkg.version <package name>
salt \(aq*\(aq pkg.version <package name> jail=<jail name or id>
salt \(aq*\(aq pkg.version <package1> <package2> <package3> ...
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
