.SS salt.modules.ps
.sp
A salt interface to psutil, a system and process library.
See \fI\%http://code.google.com/p/psutil\fP\&.
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B depends
.INDENT 7.0
.IP \(bu 2
psutil Python module, version 0.3.0 or later
