.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq reg.read_value HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE \(aqSOFTWARE\eSalt\(aq \(aqversion\(aq
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
