Displays a message on the LED matrix.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B message
The message to display
.TP
.B msg_type
The type of the message. Changes the appearance of the message.
.sp
Available types are:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
