Tests the implementation of mutex
.sp
CLI Examples:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq sysbench.mutex
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B salt.modules.sysbench.ping()
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
