# Used for connecting to a vCenter Server
salt \(aq*\(aq vsphere.enable_firewall_ruleset my.vcenter.location root bad\-password True \(aqsyslog\(aq             esxi_hosts=\(aq[esxi\-1.host.com, esxi\-2.host.com]\(aq
