New in version 2017.7.5.

.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Parameters
\fBreset\fP (\fI\%bool\fP) \-\- 
.sp
Attempts to reset the DSC configuration by removing the following
from \fBC:\eWindows\eSystem32\eConfiguration\fP:
