New in version 2018.3.0.


.UNINDENT
.TP
.B Returns
True if successful
.TP
.B Return type
\fI\%bool\fP
.TP
.B Raises
\fBCommandExecutionError\fP \-\- If unsuccessful
.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
