.ft C
# To grant the \(aqUsers\(aq group \(aqread & execute\(aq permissions.
salt \(aq*\(aq file.mkdir C:\eTemp\e Administrators "{\(aqUsers\(aq: {\(aqperms\(aq: \(aqread_execute\(aq}}"

# Locally using salt call
salt\-call file.mkdir C:\eTemp\e Administrators "{\(aqUsers\(aq: {\(aqperms\(aq: \(aqread_execute\(aq, \(aqapplies_to\(aq: \(aqthis_folder_only\(aq}}"

# Specify advanced attributes with a list
salt \(aq*\(aq file.mkdir C:\eTemp\e Administrators "{\(aqjsnuffy\(aq: {\(aqperms\(aq: [\(aqread_attributes\(aq, \(aqread_ea\(aq], \(aqapplies_to\(aq: \(aqthis_folder_only\(aq}}"
.ft P
