.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B salt.modules.win_servermanager.list_installed()
List installed features. Supported on Windows Server 2008 and Windows 8 and
newer.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Returns
A dictionary of installed features
.TP
.B Return type
\fI\%dict\fP
