Check if a service is available on the system.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Parameters
\fBname\fP (\fI\%str\fP) \-\- The name of the service to check
.TP
.B Returns
\fBTrue\fP if the service is available, \fBFalse\fP otherwise
.TP
.B Return type
\fI\%bool\fP
