.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT

.IP \(bu 2
\fBrandom_delay\fP (\fI\%str\fP) \-\- 
.sp
The delay time that is randomly added to the start time of the
trigger. Valid values are:
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
30 seconds
.IP \(bu 2
1 minute
.IP \(bu 2
30 minutes
.IP \(bu 2
1 hour
.IP \(bu 2
8 hours
.IP \(bu 2
1 day
.UNINDENT
