This parameter applies to the following trigger types
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Once
.IP \(bu 2
Daily
.IP \(bu 2
Weekly
.IP \(bu 2
Monthly
.IP \(bu 2
MonthlyDay
.UNINDENT
