.IP \(bu 2
30 minutes
.IP \(bu 2
1 hour
.IP \(bu 2
2 hours
.IP \(bu 2
4 hours
.IP \(bu 2
8 hours
.IP \(bu 2
12 hours
.IP \(bu 2
1 day
.IP \(bu 2
3 days (default)
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT

.IP \(bu 2
\fBdelay\fP (\fI\%str\fP) \-\- 
.sp
The time the trigger waits after its activation to start the task.
Valid values are:
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
15 seconds
.IP \(bu 2
30 seconds
.IP \(bu 2
1 minute
.IP \(bu 2
30 minutes
.IP \(bu 2
1 hour
.IP \(bu 2
8 hours
.IP \(bu 2
1 day
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fBNOTE:\fP
.INDENT 2.0
