.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B salt.modules.x509.get_pem_entries(glob_path)
Returns a dict containing PEM entries in files matching a glob
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B glob_path:
A path to certificates to be read and returned.
.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq x509.get_pem_entries "/etc/pki/*.crt"
.ft P
