.UNINDENT
.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt \(aq*\(aq x509.get_public_key /etc/pki/mycert.cer
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B salt.modules.x509.get_signing_policy(signing_policy_name)
