.SS salt.modules.zookeeper
.SS Zookeeper Module
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B maintainer
SaltStack
.TP
.B maturity
new
.TP
.B platform
all
.TP
.B depends
kazoo
.UNINDENT
.sp
New in version 2018.3.0.

.SS Configuration
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B configuration
This module is not usable until the following are specified
either in a pillar or in the minion\(aqs config file:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
zookeeper:
  hosts: zoo1,zoo2,zoo3
  default_acl:
    \- username: daniel
      password: test
      read: true
      write: true
      create: true
      delete: true
      admin: true
  username: daniel
  password: test
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
If configuration for multiple zookeeper environments is required, they can
be set up as different configuration profiles. For example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
zookeeper:
  prod:
    hosts: zoo1,zoo2,zoo3
    default_acl:
      \- username: daniel
        password: test
        read: true
        write: true
        create: true
        delete: true
        admin: true
    username: daniel
    password: test
  dev:
    hosts:
      \- dev1
      \- dev2
      \- dev3
    default_acl:
      \- username: daniel
        password: test
        read: true
        write: true
        create: true
        delete: true
        admin: true
    username: daniel
    password: test
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
