.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt\-run http.query http://somelink.com/
salt\-run http.query http://somelink.com/ method=POST             params=\(aqkey1=val1&key2=val2\(aq
salt\-run http.query http://somelink.com/ method=POST             data=\(aq<xml>somecontent</xml>\(aq
.ft P
