.sp
CLI Example:
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
salt\-run mine.update \(aq*\(aq
salt\-run mine.update \(aqjuniper\-edges\(aq tgt_type=\(aqnodegroup\(aq
.ft P
.fi
