.SS salt.sdb.yaml
.sp
Pull sdb values from a YAML file
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B maintainer
SaltStack
.TP
.B maturity
New
.TP
.B platform
all
.UNINDENT
.sp
New in version 2017.7.0.

.sp
Configuration:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
my\-yaml\-file:
  driver: yaml
  files:
    \- /path/to/foo.yaml
    \- /path/to/bar.yaml
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The files are merged together and the result is searched using the same
mechanism Salt uses for searching Grains and Pillar data structures.
.sp
Optional configuration:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
my\-yaml\-file:
  driver: yaml
  files:
    \- /path/to/foo.yaml
    \- /path/to/bar.yaml
  merge:
    strategy: smart
    merge_list: false
  gpg: true
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
New in version 2018.3.0.

.sp
Setting the \fBgpg\fP option to \fBtrue\fP (default is \fBfalse\fP) will decrypt
embedded GPG\-encrypted data using the \fBGPG renderer\fP\&.
