.SS salt.states.ethtool
.sp
Configuration of network device
.sp
New in version 2016.11.0.

.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B codeauthor
Krzysztof Pawlowski <\fI\%msciciel@msciciel.eu\fP>
.TP
.B maturity
new
.TP
.B depends
python\-ethtool
.TP
.B platform
linux
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
eth0:
  ethtool.coalesce:
    \- name: eth0
    \- rx_usecs: 24
    \- tx_usecs: 48

eth0:
  ethtool.ring:
    \- name: eth0
    \- rx: 1024
    \- tx: 1024

eth0:
  ethtool.offload:
    \- name: eth0
    \- tcp_segmentation_offload: on
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B salt.states.ethtool.coalesce(name, **kwargs)
Manage coalescing settings of network device
.INDENT 7.0
