or removed. This module will use RVM or rbenv if they are installed. In that case,
you can specify what ruby version and gemset to target.
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
addressable:
  gem.installed:
    \- user: rvm
    \- ruby: jruby@jgemset
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
