.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
ensure user test is absent in github:
    github.absent:
        \- name: \(aqExample TestUser1\(aq
        \- email: example@domain.com
        \- username: \(aqgitexample\(aq
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The following parameters are required:
