    Duration: 8755.788 ms
     Changes:
              \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
              diff:
                  [edit system ntp]
                       peer 192.168.0.1 { ... }
                  +    peer 172.17.17.1;
                  +    peer 172.17.17.3;

Summary for juniper.device
