redis Python module
.UNINDENT
.TP
.B configuration
See \fBsalt.modules.redis\fP for setup instructions.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.nf
.ft C
key_in_redis:
  redis.string:
    \- value: string data
.ft P
.fi
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
The redis server information specified in the minion config file can be
overridden in states using the following arguments: \fBhost\fP, \fBpost\fP, \fBdb\fP,
