.B ssh_keys
The SSH key to manage
.TP
.B user
The user who owns the SSH authorized keys file to modify
.TP
.B enc
Defines what type of key is being used; can be ed25519, ecdsa, ssh\-rsa
or ssh\-dss
.TP
.B comment
The comment to be placed with the SSH public key
.TP
