.B Parameters
.INDENT 7.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBopts\fP (\fI\%dict\fP) \-\- The Salt options dictionary
.IP \(bu 2
\fBfunctions\fP (\fI\%dict\fP) \-\- A dictionary of minion modules, with module names as
keys and funcs as values.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 7.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
