.SS Runner Changes
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Runners can now call out to utility modules
via \fB__utils__\fP\&.
.IP \(bu 2
ref:\fIUtility modules <writing\-utility\-modules>\fP (placed in
\fBsalt://_utils/\fP) are now able to be synced to the master, making it easier
to use them in custom runners. A \fBsaltutil.sync_utils\fP function has been added to the
\fBsaltutil runner\fP to facilitate the syncing of
utility modules to the master.
.UNINDENT
.SS Pillar Changes
.INDENT 0.0
