.SS Minion Blackout
.sp
During a blackout, minions will not execute any remote execution commands,
except for \fBsaltutil.refresh_pillar\fP\&. Blackouts are enabled using a special
pillar key, \fBminion_blackout\fP set to \fBTrue\fP\&.
.sp
See Minion Blackout\&.
